{"q":{"g":"In this quest you have to place 1 WI-FI Camera each on Woods, Shoreline and Factory. On Woods it has to be placed at a rock ledge with a tree on the mountain. On Shoreline it has to be placed at the top of the lighthouse near the pier. On Factory it has to be placed at the top of the office area stairs that are on the \"Gate 3\" extraction side, on the wall next to a broken chair. Note: Can not be completed at night at the current time.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/d/d2/Viewer_Woodsmap.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240709004302","c":"Location marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/2/2c/ViewerWoodsLocationOverview.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240709004727","c":"Placement location surroundings"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/2/29/ViewerWoodsLocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240709003339","c":"Placement location"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/5/57/The_TerraGroup_Trail_-_Part_19_Lighthouse_Map.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230802205828","c":"Lighthouse location marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/b/be/Lighthouse.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230321203427","c":"The lighthouse"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/5/54/ViewerFactoryLocation.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20240829224610","c":"Placement location"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}